# Keep repository plumbing OUT of the deployed asset bundle.
# Everything not listed here IS uploaded and served as a public file.
#
# Do NOT add "_headers" or "_redirects" here — Cloudflare needs them in the
# asset bundle to apply cache rules / redirects.

# git plumbing
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore

# repo docs & tooling
README.md
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.github

# OS / editor noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini
